# Market S bait cross-sell for sticker customers (learned 2026-09-25)

## Intent

Parents who buy **name-label stickers** may also want a small **Market S** add-on (Mediheel tea-tree style ~**$2.50** letter-friendly bait). Offer a **quiet, optional** path into Market S — not a campaign takeover.

## What already ships

| Piece | Behavior |
|-------|----------|
| `findMarketSBaitProduct` | Live HotGoods SKU, ~$2.50, name/brand/description matches Mediheel / tea tree, in stock |
| `MarketSBaitCrossSell` | One compact card: image, price, Add to cart, View |
| Surfaces | Sticker **PDP** only (when `category === 'Stickers'`), **cart**, sticker **customize** |
| Hide when | No matching SKU, OOS, or bait **already in cart** |

Owner still registers the bait SKU in Admin (`HotGoods` / Single Item). Widget stays **invisible** until that SKU exists — no empty banner.

## Customer comfort (do not annoy)

**Do**

- One small card — not a modal, not full-bleed hero, not homepage takeover
- Soft rose border / light fill — secondary to Customize / Add to cart / checkout
- Skip if bait already in cart
- Login note only when guest tries add-to-cart (same as rest of shop)
- Prefer **letter-safe** cheap single so sticker + bait can stay a light parcel story when qty rules allow

**Do not**

- Popups, countdown, “limited offer!” spam, auto-add to cart
- Show on Market S PDP / hub (they are already there)
- Show on Profile Liked or Orders Buy again (wrong intent)
- Stack multiple Market S promos on the same screen
- Block checkout or customize if bait is missing
- Put bait on homepage Hero (homepage-protection)

## Placement hierarchy

1. Sticker PDP — after purchase CTAs / near like (secondary)
2. Customize — side/below flow, not covering the design canvas
3. Cart — one slot in summary column

If all three show the **same** card in one journey, that is OK only because each page is a different step; never open a fourth surface without product ask.

## Cousins

- Shipping: Single Item letter rules — `market-s-k-beauty-plan.mdc`
- Subcategory: only Single Item / Family Bundle — `market-s-subcategory-fields.mdc`
- Cart Single→Family Bundle upsell (linked SKUs): `lib/marketSBundleUpsell.ts` + `MarketSBundleUpsell` — separate from this sticker bait
- Hygiene copy on Market S hub stays separate from this bait card
